edges:
- an empty queue :: "push" not in commands :: run(["MinQueue", "get_min"], [[], []])
- the smallest item leaves :: "push" in commands and "pop" in commands :: run(["MinQueue", "push", "push", "pop", "get_min"], [[], [1], [5], [], []])
